data: {"id":"chatcmpl-efe77d06-bdbf-466f-9a3c-ec43b8275778","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795552645,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"R9 confirms the record size calculation, ensuring no integer overflow during the offset computation. R10's checksum verification uses the Fletcher-16 algorithm; the checksum logic needs careful examination to guarantee the modulo operation is correct and prevent incorrect results. Verification of the checksum logic revealed the potential for integer overflow during the addition of bytes to `s1`, which has been carefully checked. The overflow can be prevented by a simple conditional check `if (s1 >= 255) s1 -= 255;`. The full checksum logic is deemed correct and safe.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

data: {"id":"chatcmpl-efe77d06-bdbf-466f-9a3c-ec43b8275778","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795552645,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The checksum logic's integer overflow prevention appears sound, eliminating costly modulo operations during checksum calculation. Detailed checks confirm the byte extraction and comparison against the stored checksum bytes are also accurate. The current logic effectively streamlines the checksum verification process in Phase 1.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

data: {"id":"chatcmpl-efe77d06-bdbf-466f-9a3c-ec43b8275778","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795552645,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Phase 1, verifying the integrity of the WAL, identifies the `validLength` and `tornTail` flag without allocating an `ArrayList` to store record offsets; Phase 2 can efficiently iterate from the known start. The offset walk guarantees all intact records will be processed in log order, directly addressing P1, P2, P3, and P5. The integrity check and iteration strategy significantly reduces memory overhead.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

data: {"id":"chatcmpl-efe77d06-bdbf-466f-9a3c-ec43b8275778","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795552645,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"R13 requires meticulous verification for each record type, given the complex payload structure. Focused on ensuring the size (`n`) calculation aligns with the key and value lengths within each record, examining each type separately. The checks involve extracting key and value lengths from payload bytes and verifying against the overall record size, to detect any size mismatches.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

